{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act32side_level_act32side_st03",
  "groupId": "act32side",
  "stageId": "act32side_st03",
  "title": "藝術館餐廳",
  "storyCode": "CR-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7930965f3db3cb7241fee0eefc9a004fb9ff8e5534876798959f515bb99cf5fd",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我記得現在是午休時間，如果需要提審，你可能要晚點來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不是來提審你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，怎麼，羅德島也想踩著我的屍體分一杯羹嗎？歡迎歡迎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是來替坎黛拉女士告知你多索雷斯對你的最終處理結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "依據多索雷斯市長辦公室的判斷，多索雷斯將不會審判你的罪行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓我猜猜，把我交給聯合政府？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然馬特奧是個蠢貨，但他畢竟是聯合政府在多索雷斯的代表。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯……我三番五次地耍他玩，聯合政府肯定等不及要把我挫骨揚灰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你對局勢的判斷很精準。聯合政府確實想把你抓去拉烏尼達公審，就像他們對馬特奧做的一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一場公審？很好，我很期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，雷內爾先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你將被送回卡西米爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你再說一次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "商業聯合會向坎黛拉施加了壓力，希望將你送回卡西米爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你再說一次？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你父親在聯合會中留下的人脈發揮了作用，你現在不必留在多索雷斯，也不用去拉烏尼達，你可以回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不……我不會回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不會回到那些最卑鄙、最下賤、最可悲的東西中去……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "事到如今也由不得你了，雷內爾先生，不管你的最終歸屬是哪裡，都是你魯莽行動造成的結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是苦是甜，你都得自己嚥下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，老東西……你還真是陰魂不散啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對了，還有一件事，你需要決定你財產的歸屬問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說得好像，我真的能自己決定一樣，坎黛拉不是早就想方設法把它們挪去其他地方了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有一些固定資產……沒有人敢接手……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你就在這份轉讓合約上隨便寫個名字吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……那就是下一個路過這裡的人好了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "迪亞茲先生，你來監區幹什麼？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亞茲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "指認假裝人質的馬特奧手下啊。反倒是你，你叫我幹嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒、沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亞茲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸……你……反正還沒落筆，你隨時可以反悔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反悔？我從來都不反悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……何況，這麼一想也不賴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把它留給真正熱愛藝術的傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雷內爾最後真的把那位老消防員的名字寫上去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的。送他出多索雷斯的時候，我最後向他確認了一次，他還是在監區的那套說辭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……他真是連他父親一丁點的特質都沒有繼承。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說實話，他大概不討厭這種評價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然，但這句話可不是在誇他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市長保鏢",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "坎黛拉女士，您和埃內斯托先生的咖啡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好濃的香氣！布克先生，我能請教一下用的是哪種咖啡豆嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市長保鏢",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是坎黛拉女士最近常喝的三種深烘豆拼配。請二位慢用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在事情告一段落，要見見你在多索雷斯其他的熟人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其實我在進城之前沒想過要驚動任何人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "的確，如果一切都風平浪靜的話，你本可以不驚動任何人，但多索雷斯永遠不可能風平浪靜，你從來都知道這一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像現在，雷內爾的這場鬧劇過後，聯合政府在多索雷斯的聲勢遭到了沉重打擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "儘管從拉烏尼達寄來的抗議信一封接一封，但雷內爾和他的財產，他們想都別想。多索雷斯不是他們俯首貼耳的附庸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可與之相應，其餘雙方也已經迫不及待——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……看看我，光顧著說這些沒意思的東西了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼會，這些都是很有意義的訊息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來，埃內斯托，嚐嚐看這種拼配合不合你的口味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很濃郁……但也很奇妙的口感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說來聽聽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我能分辨出三種豆的品種和香氣，但我說不清究竟哪種豆才是其中佔比最大的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三種香氣原本各自為戰，此消彼長，可很快又會在口中融匯成濃烈的焦香，再也不分彼此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "精準。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這種拼配最大的賣點在於它沒有嚴苛的比例限制，只要三種豆的佔比不出現太大差距，就總能保持這種穩定的焦香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼樣，合你的口味嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還沒辦法下結論？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒關係，那家店就在那裡，只要你回來，隨時都喝得到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不僅如此，只要你想，讓那家咖啡店以你的想法調配豆子，甚至往咖啡裡加氣泡水，也絕非不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，您說笑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說笑嗎？我倒不這麼認為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為我的確很期待你的選擇，埃內斯托。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喲，埃內斯托，你和這位坎黛拉市長聊了好長時間啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒辦法，我和她也算是老相識，還有蠻多東西要聊的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聊了這麼久，她是不是還挺喜歡你的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這個人……跟自己相關的東西，是真的一句話也不願多說啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，既然你不願意說，那我就不打聽了，哼哼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算你去問拉菲艾拉，她也不會告訴你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是會什麼讀心的源石技藝嗎？你怎麼知道我要去問拉菲艾拉的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都寫在你臉上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖嘖嘖，這人好可怕啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "順便，我倒是從早上出發前就知道一定會遲到，也很感謝你一直在這裡等我，但我們現在已經錯過和迪亞茲約好的時間了哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——糟了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "商業聯合會員工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼，雷內爾·科瓦爾斯基先生，您請先上車，我去拿行李。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雷內爾面無表情地坐進後座，等車門合上後，他覺得溫度有些高，於是將外套脫下放在一旁，隨後倚在靠背上，正準備鬆開自己的衣領。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但車外一聲異響打斷了他的動作，他轉頭看向窗外，看見商業聯合會的員工暈倒在車旁，不省人事。\n隨後，輕敲玻璃的聲響從車的另一側響起，他順著聲音回頭，看見有個熟悉的人站在車外。\n雷內爾搖下車窗，與一雙黑亮的眼睛對上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可以麻煩您載我一程嗎，先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你要去哪裡呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這不一向是由你來決定的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以前你總跟著我四處奔波，或許這次該由你來決定我們的目的地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你真的沒有想去的地方嗎，米沃什？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去哪裡都一樣，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是有些不一樣的，這次我真的身無分文了，除了後車箱那兩個行李箱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然如此，我來開車好了，等到燃料耗盡，車停在哪裡，我們就去哪裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯……好，你說了算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "衝著雷內爾露出一個笑容，米沃什打開前門，坐上了駕駛位，在啟動前，他從後視鏡看到了雷內爾的臉。\n此刻，雷內爾的表情混合著迷惑、欣喜和些許的猶豫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看起來有些話想問我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼回來？為什麼不離開？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你難道不知道答案嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許我不是詢問，我只是想證實那個答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……別這麼篤定，或許我很快就會因為忍受不了你而選擇離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但不是今天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米沃什",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對，不是今天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "從後視鏡收回視線，米沃什重重發動引擎，銀色轎車絕塵而去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "如今，克里斯達爾藝術館的展廳仍然保持著那一天的樣貌。\n破碎的展櫃，被燒焦的地面，出現裂痕的牆體；五彩斑斕的射燈，肆意妄為的塗鴉，狂放不羈的音樂……\n除了房間正中央的大圓桌。\n火候正好的烤肉正在桌上上滋滋作響，散發出誘人的香氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亞茲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "動手啊，怎麼都沒反應？難道不餓？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……只是沒想到這裡會變成烤肉店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亞茲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，這棟樓被當成了戰場，又被炸彈炸了一通，那些藝術品沒辦法放在這，樓空著又可惜，不如拿來弄點副業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亞茲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛好多索雷斯電視台缺了雷內爾這個熱點，開始把鼻子伸到我們社區來，造謠說我們的藝術家們沒人會做飯，整天吃仙人掌乾過日子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亞茲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我倒要讓他們看看什麼才是真正的玻利瓦爾美食！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那，這個串烤洋蔥蘑菇馱獸肉來一份——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "兩份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亞茲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒問題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼……迪亞茲先生的手藝真是沒話說啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說真的，我們四個也在泰拉遊歷了許多地方，玻利瓦爾的烤肉可還是第一次品嚐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們之前都去了哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們一開始落在了薩爾貢的荒漠裡，在羅德島短暫停留，取得了“虹彩小隊”身分之後，我們各自又去了一些地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薩爾貢的雨林，薩米的冰原，哥倫比亞的礦場和城市，烏薩斯針葉林間的村莊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "儘管如此，我們踏足過的地方也只是這片大地很小的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唯一的遺憾是列維·克里奇科和他瘋狂的實驗室一起埋在了薩爾貢的地下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果有人犯了思鄉病，恐怕只能找一條跟來時不一樣的路回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你們找到了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（聳肩）還差得遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想你們一定不介意多幾個旅伴幫你們一起找。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，越多越好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，Lord，那個是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "各位，我來替Lord隆重介紹一下這款“烏薩斯特飲”——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "窗外忽然傳來吵鬧聲。\n吃飽喝足的虹彩小隊成員們扭頭看去，習慣性地以為克里斯達爾藝術館外又出了什麼麻煩——\n然後，第一個明白了是什麼情況的人無奈地聳了聳肩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區畫家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們已經跟老爹說好了，今天輪到我們跳沃爾珀小步舞的用這塊廣場，你們的古典音樂該關掉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窘迫的貴族",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是特克諾說她最近就喜歡聽我們三拍子的華爾滋！不信你問她，她就在牆旁邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區居民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就是就是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區畫家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "特克諾，你過來，你說這事情到底怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，別用這種事煩我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有時間為了放什麼音樂吵架，不如來看看我的作品！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區畫家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的作品？可你的手……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，過來就知道了啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區畫家",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗚哦！這……這真的是你畫的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，我苦練了這麼長時間，終於抓到用左手發力的訣竅了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪亞茲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "特克諾，別練了，快進來！你一定沒喝過這種叫烏薩斯特飲的東西，再晚就沒有了哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
